# Trust model (docs/guide/how-trust.md).
title: An agent's change lands only after base-branch CI and a human pass, and ship records who gave it
direction: down
input: Untrusted text: issues, comments, tool output
agent: Agent lane writes as the bot (or human fallback)
pr: Pull request on a story branch
ci: CI from the base branch: merge gate, protected paths
pass: Human pass: approval, or recorded solo bypass
ship: aayu ship merges and writes ship.json
input -> agent: wrapped as data
agent -> pr: opens
pr -> ci: judged by
ci -> pass: checks reported
pass -> ship: checked by ship
